This is how things could be done in previous framework.
But now framework completely changed.

Now:
- entity passed in missing preview has only one component (statePreview or missingPreview component) so it can be attached using hierarchy to anything
- there are multiple interaction entities so code has directly refer to entity passed in method

Current placeholders: ```go
// show preview B
func (s *service) OnObjectStateUpsert(entity ecs.EntityID) {
    // draw circle around object
}
```

